# What the container build does not need to see.
#
# The context is the whole repository because the CMake build reads `VERSION` from
# the parent directory and installs files from `packaging/`. These are the parts
# that cost transfer time without contributing anything to the image.

.git
.github
.venv
native/build
native/build-debug
native/build-sanitised
native/build-ubsan
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
docs
*.png
!packaging/linux/*.png
tws_matrix_scratch.txt
